{"id":"ab9dad394482d61d","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-pbmonotone.md","title":"实值伪布尔函数的坐标单调类","display":"df-pbmonotone — 实值伪布尔函数的坐标单调类","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-pbmonotone","aliases":["27-df-pbmonotone"],"display":"df-pbmonotone — 实值伪布尔函数的坐标单调类","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbderivative]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"13.6.2","source_printed_pages":"596","source_pdf_pages":"620","verification_status":"source-definition-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-pbmonotone"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-pbmonotone</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pbmonotone — 实值伪布尔函数的坐标单调类"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3020cb523ec5a332\" href=\"?note=3020cb523ec5a332\" title=\"27-df-pbderivative\">27-df-pbderivative</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"13.6.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"596"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"620"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n,J_i\">\\(\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n,J_i\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3020cb523ec5a332\" href=\"?note=3020cb523ec5a332\" title=\"27-df-pbderivative\">27-df-pbderivative</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\le y\">\\(x\\le y\\)</span> 表示<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(x_i\\le y_i)\">\\(\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(x_i\\le y_i)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBIncreasing}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n:\\forall x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(x\\le y\\Longrightarrow f(x)\\le f(y))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PBIncreasing}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n:\\forall x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(x\\le y\\Longrightarrow f(x)\\le f(y))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBDecreasing}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n:\\forall x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(x\\le y\\Longrightarrow f(x)\\ge f(y))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PBDecreasing}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n:\\forall x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(x\\le y\\Longrightarrow f(x)\\ge f(y))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBCoordMonotone}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n:\\forall i\\in[n]\\;((\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;J_if(x)\\ge0)\\lor(\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;J_if(x)\\le0))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PBCoordMonotone}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n:\\forall i\\in[n]\\;((\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;J_if(x)\\ge0)\\lor(\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;J_if(x)\\le0))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书Definition 13.11及其后的monotone广义约定。坐标可以各自采用不同方向，零导数同时允许两方向。这里的实值坐标单调与§13.6.4称为unate的可切换almost-positive类不是同一定义，故使用不同符号。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbderivative","status":"resolved","id":"3020cb523ec5a332","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbderivative]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbderivative","status":"resolved","id":"3020cb523ec5a332","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n,J_i$ 见 [[27-df-pbderivative]]；$x\\le y$ 表示$\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(x_i\\le y_i)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n,J_i","display":false},{"tex":"x\\le y","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall i\\in[n]\\;(x_i\\le y_i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBIncreasing}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n:\\forall x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(x\\le y\\Longrightarrow f(x)\\le f(y))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBDecreasing}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n:\\forall x,y\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;(x\\le y\\Longrightarrow f(x)\\ge f(y))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBCoordMonotone}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n:\\forall i\\in[n]\\;((\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;J_if(x)\\ge0)\\lor(\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;J_if(x)\\le0))\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1494,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-124","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-pbmonotone|df-pbmonotone — 实值伪布尔函数的坐标单调类]]"},{"id":"ca317ab16dd3c14a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$；$J_i,\\mathrm{PBIncreasing}_n,\\mathrm{PBDecreasing}_n,\\mathrm{PBCoordMonotone}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pbmonotone]]。$s\\in\\{0,1\\}^n$ 满足：每个$i\\in[n]$，若$J_if$处处非负则$s_i=1$，否则$s_i=0$。"}],"outgoing":["3020cb523ec5a332"]}